WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.603
D-DAD? DAD?

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:07.206
DAD!

00:00:07.239 --> 00:00:08.574
- HEY, WHAT'S WRONG, MAN?

00:00:08.607 --> 00:00:10.276
- I WAS HAVING A NIGHTMARE.

00:00:10.309 --> 00:00:13.079
- OH, AGAIN?

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:19.119
WHAT, YOU WANT TO TALK ABOUT IT?
- I MISS MOMMY.

00:00:20.419 --> 00:00:23.289
- HEY, I KNOW.
I KNOW.

00:00:23.322 --> 00:00:25.591
IT'S--HEY, ME TOO.
ME TOO, PAL.

00:00:25.624 --> 00:00:26.826
- [sniffling]

00:00:26.859 --> 00:00:29.729
- COME HERE, MAN.
- [sobbing]

00:00:29.762 --> 00:00:31.631
- IT'S ALL RIGHT.
HEY, IT'S OKAY.

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:34.600
IT'S GONNA BE OKAY.
SHH, SHH, SHH.

00:00:34.633 --> 00:00:37.603
- I JUST DON'T WANT ANYTHING
TO EVER HAPPEN TO YOU.

00:00:37.636 --> 00:00:38.737
- HAPPEN TO ME?

00:00:38.771 --> 00:00:42.175
HEY, COME ON, MAN, AIN'T NOTHING
EVER GONNA HAPPEN TO ME.

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.644
- REALLY?

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:47.480
- Y-YEAH.
THAT'S WHAT I SAID.

00:00:47.513 --> 00:00:48.848
SO, YES.

00:00:48.881 --> 00:00:50.783
THAT, UM, NOTHING EVER GONNA
HAPPEN TO ME.

00:00:50.816 --> 00:00:52.285
AMD YOU AIN'T NEVER
GONNA HAVE TO WORRY

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:53.486
ABOUT NOTHING
HAPPENING TO ME.

00:00:53.519 --> 00:00:55.788
- BUT--BUT--WHAT IF--

00:00:55.821 --> 00:00:59.692
WHAT IF YOU GOT HIT BY A CAR
OR SOMETHING?

00:00:59.725 --> 00:01:03.362
- THAT'S IMPOSSIBLE,
BECAUSE I WILL NEVER DIE,

00:01:03.395 --> 00:01:06.766
S-SO I CAN'T...

00:01:06.799 --> 00:01:08.568
DIE, NO MATTER WHAT.

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:09.802
- YOU CAN'T DIE?

00:01:09.835 --> 00:01:12.806
BUT I THOUGHT
ALL HUMAN BEINGS DIED.

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:17.343
- THAT'S TRUE.
THAT'S TRUE.

00:01:17.376 --> 00:01:19.445
THAT'S SCIENCE,
SO THAT'S TRUE.

00:01:19.478 --> 00:01:24.283
BUT I AM LUCKY,
'CAUSE I AM NOT A HUMAN.

00:01:24.316 --> 00:01:26.786
- YOU'RE NOT?

00:01:26.819 --> 00:01:29.822
- I NEVER TOLD YOU ABOUT THIS?
- NO.

00:01:29.855 --> 00:01:31.390
- HEY, YOU KNOW,
I'LL JUST LET IT OUT.

00:01:31.423 --> 00:01:35.661
I'M FROM A PLANET CALLED
L-LA--THELONIOUS,

00:01:35.694 --> 00:01:38.131
AND THE THING IS,
IT WAS BEING DESTROYED.

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:39.132
- OKAY.

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:40.366
- THAT'S WHAT HAPPENED.

00:01:40.399 --> 00:01:43.603
MY--WAS--I WAS SENT DOWN
HERE IN--IN--

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:46.539
IN A CAPSULE TO EARTH
BY MY PARENTS.

00:01:46.572 --> 00:01:48.808
- OH, LIKE SUPERMAN.

00:01:48.841 --> 00:01:51.277
- SUPERMAN, YEP.

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:54.547
THAT IS WHAT
IT IS EXACTLY LIKE, EXCEPT--

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:56.682
OH, HERE'S THE THING
ABOUT MY VERSION.

00:01:56.715 --> 00:01:59.418
ONLY ONE SUPERPOWER--
IMMORTALITY.

00:01:59.451 --> 00:02:01.154
- OH.
- YEAH.

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:02.255
SO I'M TIRED.

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:03.890
DADDY'S TIRED.

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:06.692
CAN YOU--
LET'S GO TO SLEEP, OKAY?

00:02:06.725 --> 00:02:09.162
- BUT I'M NOT GOING TO LIVE
FOREVER, RIGHT?

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:11.197
BECAUSE I'M ONLY HALF ALIEN.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:14.300
[sobbing]

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:16.469
SO I'M GONNA DIE.

00:02:16.502 --> 00:02:18.437
- MM-HMM, MM-HMM,
MM-HMM, MM-HMM.

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:20.406
YOU?

00:02:20.439 --> 00:02:24.210
YOU--YOU RIGHT
ABOUT YOURSELF, EX--

00:02:24.243 --> 00:02:25.211
BUT--

00:02:25.244 --> 00:02:26.879
HA HA HA!

00:02:26.912 --> 00:02:28.214
HERE IT IS.

00:02:28.247 --> 00:02:30.383
THIS ONE SLIPPED MY MIND.

00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:33.686
YOU CAN BUILD WITH ME

00:02:33.719 --> 00:02:35.788
AN IMMORTALITY MACHINE

00:02:35.821 --> 00:02:37.823
TO GIVE YOU WHAT I GOT

00:02:37.856 --> 00:02:39.725
FROM THE REMNANTS
OF MY SPACECRAFT.

00:02:39.758 --> 00:02:41.194
SO, YEAH.

00:02:41.227 --> 00:02:43.629
- WOW.
- YOU GONNA BE IMMORTAL.

00:02:43.662 --> 00:02:45.331
YOU GONNA BE IMMORTAL.

00:02:45.364 --> 00:02:48.234
- DADDY, WHEN ARE WE GONNA GET
THE REMNANTS?

00:02:48.267 --> 00:02:49.869
- TOMORROW.
- TOMORROW?

00:02:49.902 --> 00:02:51.337
[gasps]

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:55.808
- GONNA GET THEM TOMORROW
DURING WORK.

00:02:55.841 --> 00:02:57.810
HEY, YOU GOT ANYTHING
THAT LOOKS LIKE PARTS

00:02:57.843 --> 00:03:00.346
OF A CRASHED SPACESHIP?

00:03:00.379 --> 00:03:01.614
- DEAD MOM?
- MM-HMM.

00:03:01.647 --> 00:03:04.717
- MM-HMM.
RIGHT THIS WAY.

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:05.750
[applause]

